<title>USA: GTE's GTE North issues $250 million in debt.</title>
<headline>GTE's GTE North issues $250 million in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from GTE Corp unit GTE North was won and priced via competitive bid on Tuesday, according to high bidder Morgan Stanley &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER GTE NORTH</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	  COUPON 6.90 PCT   MATURITY 11/01/08</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 5/01/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A1	 YIELD 6.90 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA	   SPREAD 47 BP	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>NOTE PRICED OVER THE 10-YEAR U.S TREASURY</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
